                <note rend="inline" type="source">717.2114/57: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Nicaragua</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Munro</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-11-11T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 11,
                                1927—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>190. Your 327, November 11, 11 a.m. Department expects to be able to give you an
                    answer next week.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
